Use this rule when planning Mango Tree work. Plans should be decision complete, layer-oriented, and include validation for runtime contracts. Emphasize coordinator routing, app tool boundaries, scoped access, structured outputs, traceability, and denial tests. Name the affected layer: web, api, agents, utils/apps/{name}, or utils/shared.
